<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1" xmlns:trp="http://www.garmin.com/xmlschemas/TripExtensions/v1" version="1.1" creator="The Lenwood Gazette">
  <metadata>
    <name>Willow Glen Christmas Lights — Driving Route</name>
    <desc>Driving route through Willow Glen's Christmas lights, San Jose: Carolyn Ave, Glen Eyrie Ave, Camino Ricardo, Glen Brook Ave, Glen Echo Ave, Camino Ramon, Glen Dell Dr, Camino Pablo, and the full run down Cherry Ave to Minnesota Ave, then back up Lincoln Ave. Native inRoute format (Garmin TripExtensions): start/finish are trp:ViaPoint; each turn is a trp:ShapingPoint placed just PAST the junction, on the street being turned onto, so the router is committed to the turn. From The Lenwood Gazette's Christmas Lights Guide 2026.</desc>
  </metadata>
  <rte>
    <name>Willow Glen Christmas Lights — Driving Route</name>
    <rtept lat="37.308470" lon="-121.901090">
      <name>Start — Lincoln Ave &amp; Willow St</name>
      <desc>Gateway to Willow Glen. Head west on Willow St into the lights.</desc>
      <extensions>
        <trp:ViaPoint/>
      </extensions>
    </rtept>
